*> >>SET CONSTANT defines a constant, as $SET CONSTANT does; a report
*> group's OCCURS ... VARYING declares its counter.
>>SET CONSTANT DOGGY "Pluto"
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SETS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  DIGITS-TABLE.
    05  DIGS            PIC X(10) OCCURS 5 TIMES.
REPORT SECTION.
RD  DIGIT-REPORT.
01  DIGIT-LINE TYPE DETAIL.
    05  LINE 1.
        10  FILLER OCCURS 5 TIMES VARYING IDX1 FROM 1 BY 1.
            15  FILLER  PIC X(10) SOURCE DIGS (IDX1).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY DOGGY
    STOP RUN.
